                    // no `_selected`), so a rule on its "(Option text)" read nothing and was always FALSE (a2 run 1bd3c72e,
                    // 2026-10-29). It is compared by value. A provision dropdown (PaymentTerms) and a dropdown on a DROPDOWN custom
                    // field carry `_selected` {value, label} and no bare field (Test 4 run 7b93e9a7, 2026-11-15).
